      "current_English": "Create Fleet\nCreate a regional fleet commanded by a\ncompanion with Leadership of\nat least 150. Choose a policy to delegate \nits activities; you can change that \npolicy through Info.\n{Continue reading:\\xd8}\n\u0000",
