      "complete_current_continuations": [],
      "title": "Create Fleet",
      "english": "Create a regional fleet commanded by a companion with Command of at least 150. Choose a policy to delegate its activities; you can change that policy through Info. Each new fleet needs 100,000 gold coins in operating funds. You can create up to six regional fleets. If every ship in one sinks, its commander returns to your main fleet. See [[67|Manage Area]], [[68|Patrol]], [[69|Dock]] and [[70|Attack Town]].",
